          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>First, we apply the addition principle, subtracting <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 6]</span> from both sides:</p>",
            "readable_text": "First, we apply the addition principle, subtracting [MATH: 6] from both sides:",
            "images": [],
