          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Second, we apply the multiplication principle, dividing both sides by <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2{:}]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Second, we apply the multiplication principle, dividing both sides by [MATH: 2{:}]",
