        "readable_text": "Prompt:\nSolve the inequality [MATH: 6 < \u2212 2y + 7.]\n\nChoices:\na. [MATH: y > (1)/(2)]\nb. [MATH: y < (1)/(2)]\nc. [MATH: y < \u2212 2]\nd. [MATH: y > 2]\ne. [MATH: y < \u2212 (1)/(2)]"
